        {
          "text": "Izohanagura amosozi yose ku maso yabo, kand’ urupfu ntiruzoba rukiriho, kand’ amaborogo no gutaka n’uburibge ntibizoba bikiriho: kukw ivya mbere bishize.",
          "type": "text",
