              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi sinabonye urusengero kuri wo, kuk’ Umwami Imana ishobora vyose na wa Mwagazi ari bo rusengero rwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.22",
